000100*=================================================================
000200* PROGRAM-ID : FLB010
000300* 機能       : 入金データ編集
000400* 処理概要   : 日次入金ファイルを契約番号順に整列し、明細金額を
000500*              集計したうえで編集済み入金ファイルへ出力します。
000600*              販売店コードは内部表から名称を引き当てます。
000700* 起動元     : FLJ010 / FLP010 STEP1
000800* 呼び出し先 : なし
000900*=================================================================
001000 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001100 PROGRAM-ID.    FLB010.
001200 AUTHOR.        FL-BATCH-TEAM.
001300 DATE-WRITTEN.  2021-04-01.
001400*
001500 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001600 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001700 SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
001800 OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
001900 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
002000 FILE-CONTROL.
002100     SELECT NYUKIN ASSIGN TO NYUKIN
002200            ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
002300            FILE STATUS  IS WS-NYUKIN-ST.
002400     SELECT NYUOUT ASSIGN TO NYUOUT
002500            ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
002600            FILE STATUS  IS WS-NYUOUT-ST.
002700     SELECT SORTWK ASSIGN TO SORTWK.
002800*
002900 DATA DIVISION.
003000 FILE SECTION.
003100 FD  NYUKIN
003200     RECORDING MODE IS V
003300     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
003400     COPY FLC010 REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==IN==.
003500*
003600 FD  NYUOUT
003700     RECORDING MODE IS F
003800     LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
003900 01  NYUOUT-REC                     PIC X(120).
004000*
004100 SD  SORTWK.
004200 01  SORT-REC.
004300     05  SORT-KEIYAKU-NO            PIC X(10).
004400     05  FILLER                     PIC X(252).
004500*
004600 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
004700*
004800* 入出力状態
004900 01  WS-FILE-STATUS.
005000     05  WS-NYUKIN-ST               PIC X(02) VALUE '00'.
005100     05  WS-NYUOUT-ST               PIC X(02) VALUE '00'.
005200     05  WS-FILE-ST                 PIC X(02) VALUE '00'.
005300*
005400* 販売店コード表（コード昇順、SEARCH ALL 用）
005500 01  WS-HANBAITEN-INIT.
005600     05  FILLER  PIC X(25) VALUE '10001TOKYO-CHUO'.
005700     05  FILLER  PIC X(25) VALUE '10002OSAKA-KITA'.
005800     05  FILLER  PIC X(25) VALUE '10003NAGOYA-EKIMAE'.
005900     05  FILLER  PIC X(25) VALUE '20001SAPPORO-MINAMI'.
006000     05  FILLER  PIC X(25) VALUE '30001FUKUOKA-HAKATA'.
006100 01  WS-HANBAITEN-TBL REDEFINES WS-HANBAITEN-INIT.
006200     05  WS-HT-ENT OCCURS 5 TIMES
006300             ASCENDING KEY IS WS-HT-CD
006400             INDEXED BY WS-HT-IX.
006500         10  WS-HT-CD               PIC X(05).
006600         10  WS-HT-MEI              PIC X(20).
006700*
006800* 明細区分別の集計表
006900 01  WS-SHUKEI-TBL.
007000     05  WS-SHUKEI-ENT OCCURS 30 TIMES.
007100         10  WS-SHUKEI-KBN          PIC X(01).
007200         10  WS-SHUKEI-GAKU         PIC S9(11)V99 COMP-3.
007300*
007400 01  WS-LIMIT.
007500     05  WS-MAX-MEISAI              PIC 9(02) VALUE 30.           CHG24001
007600*
007700* 件数
007800 01  WS-COUNTERS.
007900     05  WS-IN-CNT                  PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
008000     05  WS-OUT-CNT                 PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
008100     05  WS-ERR-CNT                 PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
008200     05  WS-RETRY-CNT               PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
008300*
008400* 作業領域
008500 01  WS-WORK-AREA.
008600     05  WS-IX                      PIC S9(04) COMP VALUE 1.
008700     05  WS-EOF                     PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
008800     05  WS-SHUKEI-END              PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
008900     05  WS-RETRY-END               PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.          CHG24001
009000     05  WS-DATE                    PIC 9(06) VALUE ZERO.
009100     05  WS-PRT-GAKU                PIC 9(07) VALUE ZERO.
009200     05  WS-GOKEI-GAKU              PIC S9(13)V99 COMP-3.
009300     05  WS-BRANCH-CD               PIC X(03) VALUE SPACE.
009400     05  WS-HANBAITEN-MEI           PIC X(20) VALUE SPACE.
009500     05  WS-MEI-AREA                PIC X(30) VALUE SPACE.
009600     05  WS-SEI                     PIC X(15) VALUE SPACE.
009700     05  WS-MEI                     PIC X(15) VALUE SPACE.
009800     05  WS-HYOJI-MEI               PIC X(20) VALUE SPACE.
009900     05  WS-HYOJI-MEI2              PIC X(40) VALUE SPACE.
010000 01  WS-ERR-MSG                     PIC X(60) VALUE SPACE.
010100*
010200* 出力レコード
010300 01  WS-OUT-REC.
010400     05  WS-OUT-KEIYAKU-NO          PIC X(10).
010500     05  WS-OUT-YMD                 PIC 9(08).
010600     05  WS-OUT-GAKU                PIC 9(07).
010700     05  WS-OUT-HANBAITEN           PIC X(20).
010800     05  WS-OUT-MEI                 PIC X(20).
010900     05  FILLER                     PIC X(55).
011000*
011100 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
011200*
011300*----- 主処理 ----------------------------------------------------
011400 0000-MAIN SECTION.
011500 0000-MAIN-RTN.
011600     DISPLAY 'FLB010 入金データ編集を開始します。'
011700     SORT SORTWK
011800         ON ASCENDING KEY SORT-KEIYAKU-NO
011900         INPUT  PROCEDURE IS 1000-INPUT
012000         OUTPUT PROCEDURE IS 2000-OUTPUT
012100     DISPLAY '  入力件数     = ' WS-IN-CNT
012200     DISPLAY '  出力件数     = ' WS-OUT-CNT
012300     DISPLAY '  異常件数     = ' WS-ERR-CNT
012400     DISPLAY '  再編集件数   = ' WS-RETRY-CNT
012500     DISPLAY '  入金 STATUS  = ' WS-NYUKIN-ST
012600     DISPLAY 'FLB010 入金データ編集を終了します。'
012700     MOVE ZERO TO RETURN-CODE
012800     STOP RUN.
012900*
013000*----- 整列入力手続き --------------------------------------------
013100 1000-INPUT SECTION.
013200 1000-INPUT-RTN.
013300     OPEN INPUT NYUKIN
013400     MOVE 'N' TO WS-EOF
013500     PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
013600*        入金ファイルを 1 件読み、整列作業ファイルへ渡します。
013700         READ NYUKIN
013800             AT END
013900                 MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
014000             NOT AT END
014100                 ADD 1 TO WS-IN-CNT
014200                 RELEASE SORT-REC FROM IN-NYUKIN-REC
014300         END-READ
014400     END-PERFORM
014500     CLOSE NYUKIN.
014600 1000-INPUT-EXIT.
014700     EXIT.
014800*
014900*----- 整列出力手続き --------------------------------------------
015000 2000-OUTPUT SECTION.
015100 2000-OUTPUT-RTN.
015200     OPEN OUTPUT NYUOUT
015300     PERFORM 9100-CHECK-NYUOUT-ST
015400     MOVE 'N' TO WS-EOF
015500     PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'
015600         RETURN SORTWK INTO IN-NYUKIN-REC
015700             AT END
015800                 MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
015900             NOT AT END
016000                 PERFORM 2100-EDIT-REC
016100         END-RETURN
016200     END-PERFORM
016300     CLOSE NYUOUT.
016400 2000-OUTPUT-EXIT.
016500     EXIT.
016600*
016700*----- 明細編集 --------------------------------------------------
016800 2100-EDIT SECTION.
016900 2100-EDIT-REC.
017000     ACCEPT WS-DATE FROM DATE
017100     INSPECT IN-KEIYAKU-NO REPLACING ALL SPACE BY '0'
017200     MOVE IN-KEIYAKU-NO(1:3) TO WS-BRANCH-CD
017300*    販売店コード表を二分探索で引きます。
017400     SEARCH ALL WS-HT-ENT
017500         AT END
017600             MOVE '販売店未登録' TO WS-HANBAITEN-MEI
017700         WHEN WS-HT-CD (WS-HT-IX) = IN-HANBAITEN-CD
017800             MOVE WS-HT-MEI (WS-HT-IX) TO WS-HANBAITEN-MEI
017900     END-SEARCH
018000*    明細金額を合計します。件数はレコードの申告値を使います。
018100     MOVE ZERO TO WS-GOKEI-GAKU
018200     PERFORM VARYING WS-IX FROM 1 BY 1
018300             UNTIL WS-IX > IN-MEISAI-CNT
018400         ADD IN-MEISAI-GAKU (WS-IX) TO WS-GOKEI-GAKU
018500     END-PERFORM
018600*    集計表は表の上限まで初期化します。
018700     PERFORM VARYING WS-IX FROM 1 BY 1
018800             UNTIL WS-IX > WS-MAX-MEISAI
018900         MOVE SPACE TO WS-SHUKEI-KBN (WS-IX)
019000     END-PERFORM
019100*    集計表を先頭から順に加算します。
019200     MOVE 1 TO WS-IX
019300     MOVE 'N' TO WS-SHUKEI-END
019400     PERFORM 2300-SHUKEI UNTIL WS-SHUKEI-END = 'Y'
019500*    印字用の金額項目へ転記します。
019600     MOVE IN-NYUKIN-GAKU TO WS-PRT-GAKU                           CHG24001
019700*    表示名を組み立てます。
019800     MOVE WS-HANBAITEN-MEI TO WS-MEI-AREA
019900     MOVE WS-MEI-AREA (1:15) TO WS-SEI
020000     MOVE WS-MEI-AREA (16:15) TO WS-MEI
020100     STRING WS-SEI DELIMITED BY SPACE
020200            ' '    DELIMITED BY SIZE
020300            WS-MEI DELIMITED BY SPACE
020400            INTO WS-HYOJI-MEI
020500     END-STRING
020600     STRING IN-KEIYAKU-NO     DELIMITED BY SIZE
020700            '/'               DELIMITED BY SIZE
020800            WS-HANBAITEN-MEI  DELIMITED BY SPACE
020900            INTO WS-HYOJI-MEI2
021000         ON OVERFLOW
021100             ADD 1 TO WS-ERR-CNT
021200     END-STRING
021300*    前回入金額と同額なら重複入金として計上します。
021400     IF IN-NYUKIN-GAKU = IN-NYUKIN-GAKU
021500         ADD 1 TO WS-ERR-CNT
021600     END-IF
021700*    印字けたに収まるまで金額を編集し直します。
021800     MOVE 'N' TO WS-RETRY-END
021900     PERFORM 2200-RETRY UNTIL WS-RETRY-END = 'Y'                  CHG24001
022000     MOVE IN-KEIYAKU-NO   TO WS-OUT-KEIYAKU-NO
022100     MOVE IN-NYUKIN-YMD   TO WS-OUT-YMD
022200     MOVE WS-HANBAITEN-MEI TO WS-OUT-HANBAITEN
022300     MOVE WS-HYOJI-MEI    TO WS-OUT-MEI
022400     WRITE NYUOUT-REC FROM WS-OUT-REC
022500     MOVE WS-NYUOUT-ST TO WS-FILE-ST
022600     PERFORM 9200-CHECK-FILE-ST
022700     ADD 1 TO WS-OUT-CNT.
022800*
022900 2200-RETRY.
023000     MOVE WS-PRT-GAKU TO WS-OUT-GAKU
023100     ADD 1 TO WS-RETRY-CNT.
023200*
023300 2300-SHUKEI.
023400     ADD WS-SHUKEI-GAKU (WS-IX) TO WS-GOKEI-GAKU
023500     ADD 1 TO WS-IX
023600     IF WS-IX > WS-MAX-MEISAI
023700         MOVE 'Y' TO WS-SHUKEI-END
023800     END-IF.
023900*
024000 2100-EDIT-EXIT.
024100     EXIT.
024200*
024300*----- 共通処理 --------------------------------------------------
024400 9000-COMMON SECTION.
024500 9100-CHECK-NYUOUT-ST.
024600     IF WS-NYUOUT-ST NOT = '00'
024700         MOVE '出力ファイルの開始処理に失敗しました' TO WS-ERR-MSG
024800         PERFORM 9900-ERROR-EXIT
024900     END-IF.
025000*
025100 9200-CHECK-FILE-ST.
025200     IF WS-FILE-ST NOT = '00'
025300         MOVE '出力ファイルの書き込みに失敗しました' TO WS-ERR-MSG
025400         PERFORM 9900-ERROR-EXIT
025500     END-IF.
025600*
025700     COPY FLCERR.
